Adaptation scope: embedded settings.section workbench registration, four-tab
navigation and measured overflow, full-width origin-scoped task surfaces,
command palette and keyboard behavior, native DSH token geometry, scoped
modal/focus lifecycle, and status presentation. The cloud sync render components, original CSS, pure retention selector and
channel protocol patterns are additionally adopted in 1.12.0. They operate only
on encrypted password-vault data through a separate host controller; DSH
configuration migration, marketplace and profile operations are not imported
or run. Source-copy provenance is in vendor/config-manager/source-manifest.json.
Transport license: src/cloud-sync/transports/LICENSE.reference.
The retained application is a password/credential vault, not a configuration
manager. No configuration or secrets from the reference installation ship.
